--TEST--
`<?` in a run of markup is not yet a tag, so the lexer still reads it as markup, and the cursor after it is offered the tags that open code and no markup, word or type — `rule:ide/completion-is-asked-where-a-spelling-ends`
--FILE--
<h1>hi</h1>
<?<|>
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
<?=     keyword   prints one expression
<?nvs   keyword   starts a block of Novis code
